# Landing / Page Image Quality

User-facing pages / SCSS (images ပါ) edit လုပ်တိုင်း:

---

## Sources (ရင်းမြစ်)

**Placeholder / broken hotlink မသုံး:**
- `placehold.co`, `via.placeholder.com`, `dummyimage.com`, `picsum.photos`

**Prefer:**
- classic `DBS-FFW-classicsite/**/public/images/`
- SPFx `src/webparts/**/assets/`
- user-approved URLs

- third-party images — license **confirm**
- `assets/videos` under large files — slice မလိုရ unless bundle **မလုပ်**

---

## Quality & CLS (Layout Shift)

- Real product imagery — vague stock filler **မသုံး**
- Explicit `width`/`height` or CSS `aspect-ratio` — layout shift **ကာကွယ်**
- optimized sizes prefer
- below-fold = `loading="lazy"`

---

## Accessibility (A11y)

- Informative images: **specific** `alt`
- Decorative: **empty** `alt=""` (`alt=""`)
- essential copy image ထဲ **only** မထား

---

## Checks (စစ်ဆေးချက်)

- paths resolve in repo (classic images / SPFx bundled assets / property-pane URL)
- mobile + desktop crop **readable**
- error/empty states — broken-image icons **မပေါ်**
